%I A402523 #8 Nov 21 2026 23:08:22
%S A402523 1,1,2,5,14,54,257,1843,21814,508872
%N A402523 Number of simple connected graphs on n unlabeled vertices whose hull number is equal to the number of simplicial vertices.
%C A402523 Every hull set includes all simplicial vertices, so the hull number of a graph is greater than or equal to the number of simplicial vertices.
%C A402523 These graphs are also those with just one minimal hull set.
%Y A402523 Cf. A001349, A401800, A402522.
%K A402523 nonn,more,new
%O A402523 1,3
